== approval, too many Approvals (kardinal why demo prod)
prod is held by gate cab: nobody can approve this version.
  Version  1.5.0 (demo-b)
  Why      more than 100 Approvals for this version; delete the stale ones (kubectl get approvals)
  Next     delete the stale Approvals: kubectl get approvals -n default
  Or       kardinal override demo prod --gate cab --reason <why>

== a gate that opens by itself (kardinal why demo prod)
prod is held by gate no-weekend-deploys.
  Version  1.5.0 (demo-b)
  Why      Production deployments are blocked on weekends
  Rule     !schedule.isWeekend
  Now      !schedule.isWeekend = false
  Opens    when the expression passes; rechecked every 5m
  Next     kardinal override demo prod --gate no-weekend-deploys --reason <why>

== a gate that needs a person (kardinal why demo prod)
prod is held by gate label.
  Version  1.5.0 (demo-b)
  Rule     bundle.labels.approved == "yes"
  Now      bundle.labels.approved == "yes" = false
  Opens    when what it reads changes (nothing in it changes with time); rechecked every 1m
  Next     kardinal override demo prod --gate label --reason <why>

